n G2</div><div class="alertbanner_icon-container"><div data-is-ix2-target="1" class="arrow-icon" data-w-id="e5552172-ccb4-1939-1dac-28b73f828371" data-animation-type="lottie" data-src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6740a730413debfacf115060/67aa28ebe7215683d56359d4_Arrow-24x24%20(1).json" data-loop="0" data-direction="1" data-autoplay="0" data-renderer="svg" data-default-duration="0" data-duration="0.7333333333333333" data-loading="eager" data-ix2-initial-state="0"></div></div></a></div></div></div><div data-wf--vertical-space--variant="l" class="spacer w-variant-13e4797a-c62b-b476-4a73-bfbaabf18a32"></div><div><div data-wf--card-columns--variant="2-columns" class="cardcolumns_flex w-variant-b2725e9c-6f1b-5811-5d92-21e5db8293d6"><div class="cardcolumns_item1"><div class="cards_full-height"><div data-wf--quote-card-jk--variant="light-no-stroke" class="quotecard w-variant-a9bba450-9920-f9b7-4421-1e40b5ba2409"><div class="featurecard_content"><div class="featurecard_top"><div class="card_slot w-variant-a9bba450-9920-f9b7-4421-1e40b5ba2409"><div data-wf--icon---quote-large--variant="white" class="blockquote_icon w-variant-49e8f074-213e-81cc-f93d-7930c868bf54"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6740a730413debfacf115060/67eb6ad9331a6cc7f167ea51_Quotes-20px.svg" loading="lazy" alt=""/></div></div><div data-wf--vertical-space--variant="xl" class="spacer w-variant-23348c19-1ecd-e80f-378f-68c5aebe8e07"></div><div class="slot-6"><h1 data-wf--serif-headline--variant="step-2" class="serif-headline_inline w-variant-7903e099-5f30-4d54-0bc3-0532fe29b814">The pool of participants are great, the tagging system is flexible and super helpful, </h1><h2 data-wf--sans-serif-headline--variant="step-2" class="sans-serif-headline_inline w-variant-201c6dcb-dcbf-adf8-9a19-4b14dec34c93">and they now have the option to run usability tests </h2><h1 data-wf--serif-headline--variant="step-2" class="serif-headline_inline w-variant-7903e099-5f30-4d54-0bc3-0532fe29b814">(in addition to the live interviews, surveys, and diary studies). Videos are automatically transcribed. They also will handle incentives...and the support staff are all friendly, helpful, and respond quickly.</h1></div><div data-wf--vertical-space--variant="m" class="spacer w-variant-2cc0820b-145a-e502-4fce-a96bdfafee33"></div></div><div class="featurecard_bottom"><div class="quotecard-author"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6740a730413debfacf115060/67d84c7891399b3ae5e6893d_G2-logo.svg" loading="lazy" alt="G2 logo" class="quotecard-avatar"/><div><div class="step-0">User Researcher</div><div class="step--1 text-color-secondary">Enterprise Health, Wellness, and Fitness</div></div></div><div data-wf--vertical-space--variant="m" class="spacer w-variant-2cc0820b-145a-e502-4fce-a96bdfafee33"></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="cardcolumns_item2"><div class="cards_full-height"><div data-wf--quote-card-jk--variant="light-no-stroke" class="quotecard w-variant-a9bba450-9920-f9b7-4421-1e40b5ba2409"><div class="featurecard_content"><div class="featurecard_top"><div class="card_slot w-variant-a9bba450-9920-f9b7-4421-1e40b5ba2409"><div data-wf--icon---quote-large--variant="white" class="blockquote_icon w-variant-49e8f074-213e-81cc-f93d-7930c868bf54"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6740a730413debfacf115060/67eb6ad9331a6cc7f167ea51_Quotes-20px.svg" loading="lazy" alt=""/></div></div><div data-wf--vertical-space--variant="xl" class="spacer w-variant-23348c19-1ecd-e80f-378f-68c5aebe8e07"></div><div class="slot-6"><h1 data-wf--serif-headline--variant="step-2" class="serif-headline_inline w-variant-7903e099-5f30-4d54-0bc3-0532fe29b814">Dscout’s usability is much better than UserTesting...it’s a lot easier to navigate, figure out, and to use. </h1><h2 data-wf--sans-serif-headline--variant="step-2" class="sans-serif-headline_inline w-variant-201c6dcb-dcbf-adf8-9a19-4b14dec34c93">I never found myself getting frustrated with Dscout, </h2><h1 data-wf--serif-headline--variant="step-2" class="serif-headline_inline w-variant-7903e099-5f30-4d54-0bc3-0532fe29b814">whereas I get frustrated all of the time with UT.</h1></div><div data-wf--vertical-space--variant="m" class="spacer w-variant-2cc0820b-145a-e502-4fce-a96bdfafee33"></div></div><div class="featurecard_bottom"><div class="quotecard-author"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6740a730413debfacf115060/67d84c7891399b3ae5e6893d_G2-logo.svg" loading="lazy" alt="G2 logo" class="quotecard-avatar"/><div><div class="step-0">Design Research Manager</div><div class="step--1 text-color-secondary">Enterprise eCommerce</div></div></div><div data-wf--vertical-space--variant="m" class="spacer w-variant-2cc0820b-145a-e502-4fce-a96bdfafee33"></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="cardcolumns_item3 w-variant-b2725e9c-6f1b-5811-5d92-21e5db8293d6"><div class="cards_full-height"><div data-wf--logocard-jk--variant="base-no-stroke" class="statcard w-variant-ebd22ac8-23fc-aa88-9098-3a8b2c175b05"><div class="numbercard-content w-variant-ebd22ac8-23fc-aa88-9098-3a8b2c175b05"><div class="card_slot"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6740a730413debfacf115060/692f6fa747d6fd3c4ee9a213_359b767f961115ca0f7398051b5cbaa9_Cal-Meet-logo.svg" loading="lazy" width="70" data-wf--image--image-style="square-cover" alt="" data-style-image="" class="full-width_img w-variant-342b4d26-adaa-5b8f-b9df-dcdbd3879f86"/></div><div data-wf--vertical-space--variant="xl" class="spacer w-variant-23348c19-1ecd-e80f-378f-68c5aebe8e07"></div><div class="component_rtb-dark-text w-richtext"><p>Quickly schedule live interviews with auto-synced calendars, invites, and unique links for each participant.</p></div><div data-wf--vertical-space--variant="xs" class="spacer w-variant-0588b157-3093-8d53-2b14-4cd7cbeb464f"></div></div></div></div></div><div class="cardcolumns_item4 w-variant-b2725e9c-6f1b-5811-5d92-21e5db8293d6"><div class="cards_full-height"></div></div><div class="cardcolumns_item5 w-variant-b2725e9c-6f1b-5811-5d92-21e5db8293d6"><div class="cards_full-height"></div></div></div></div><div data-wf--vertical-space--variant="2xs" class="spacer w-variant-f94313cb-d46b-d556-b8fd-3e9f3e14c0c0"></div></section><section data-wf--statementlinks--variant="base" class="statementlinks"><div data-wf--vertical-space--variant="none" class="spacer w-variant-9cdcdbd4-4edb-8a94-1d92-994724fe829a"></div><div><div data-wf--card-columns--variant="2-columns" class="cardcolumns_flex w-variant-b2725e9c-6f1b-5811-5d92-21e5db8293d6"><div class="cardcolumns_item1"><div class="cards_full-height"><div data-wf--quote-card-jk--variant="light-no-stroke" class="quotecard w-variant-a9bba450-9920-f9b7-4421-1e40b5ba2409"><div class="featurecard_content"><div class="featurecard_top"><div class="card_slot w-variant-a9bba450-9920-f9b7-4421-1e40b5ba2409"><div data-wf--icon---quote-large--variant="white" class="blockquote_icon w-variant-49e8f074-213e-81cc-f93d-7930c868bf54"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6740a730413debfacf115060/67eb6ad9331a6cc7f167ea51_Quotes-20px.svg" loading="lazy" alt=""/></div></div><div data-wf--vertical-space--variant="xl" class="spacer w-variant-23348c19-1ecd-e80f-378f-68c5aebe8e07"></div><div class="slot-6"><h1 data-wf--serif-headline--variant="step-2" class="serif-headline_inline w-variant-7903e099-5f30-4d54-0bc3-0532fe29b814">I love the support from the Dscout team. It’s also really nice to be able to have all aspects of the project in one place... not many platforms have such a holistic project setup available for researchers. </h1><h2 data-wf--sans-serif-headline--variant="step-2" class="sans-serif-headline_inline w-variant-201c6dcb-dcbf-adf8-9a19-4b14dec34c93">The convenience of having all these research tools in one place and having on-call help from Dscout makes this platform invaluable… </h2><h1 data-wf--serif-headline--variant="step-2" class="serif-headline_inline w-variant-7903e099-5f30-4d54-0bc3-0532fe29b814">I’m convinced Dscout is likely the best platform of its kind.</h1></div><div data-wf--vertical-space--variant="m" class="spacer w-variant-2cc0820b-145a-e502-4fce-a96bdfafee33"></div></div><div class="featurecard_bottom"><div class="quotecard-author"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6740a730413debfacf115060/67d84c7891399b3ae5e6893d_G2-logo.svg" loading="lazy" alt="G2 logo" class="quotecard-avatar"/><div><div class="step-0">Research Program Manager</div><div class="step--1 text-color-secondary">Mid-Market-Research Organization</div></div></div><div data-wf--vertical-space--variant="m" class="spacer w-variant-2cc0820b-145a-e502-4fce-a96bdfafee33"></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="cardcolumns_item2"><div class="cards_full-height"><div data-wf--quote-card-jk--variant="light-no-stroke" class="quotecard w-variant-a9bba450-9920-f9b7-4421-1e40b5ba2409"><div class="featurecard_content"><div class="featurecard_top"><div class="card_slot w-variant-a9bba450-9920-f9b7-4421-1e40b5ba2409"><div data-wf--icon---quote-large--variant="white" class="blockquote_icon w-variant-49e8f074-213e-81cc-f93d-7930c868bf54"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6740a730413debfacf115060/67eb6ad9331a6cc7f167ea51_Quotes-20px.svg" loading="lazy" alt=""/></div></div><div data-wf--vertical-space--variant="xl" class="spacer w-variant-23348c19-1ecd-e80f-378f-68c5aebe8e07"></div><div class="slot-6"><h1 data-wf--serif-headline--variant="step-2" class="serif-headline_inline w-variant-7903e099-5f30-4d54-0bc3-0532fe29b814">Dscout streamlines my research by enabling easy participant selection and interviews, </h1><h2 data-wf--sans-serif-headline--variant="step-2" class="sans-serif-headline_inline w-variant-201c6dcb-dcbf-adf8-9a19-4b14dec34c93">enhances efficiency with AI features and transcripts, and supports collaboration, </h2><h1 data-wf--serif-headline--variant="step-2" class="serif-headline_inline w-variant-7903e099-5f30-4d54-0bc3-0532fe29b814">significantly easing my workload in managing and analyzing qualitative research.</h1></div><div data-wf--vertical-space--variant="m" class="spacer w-variant-2cc0820b-145a-e502-4fce-a96bdfafee33"></div></div><div class="featurecard_bottom"><div class="quotecard-author"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6740a730413debfacf115060/67d84c7891399b3ae5e6893d_G2-logo.svg" loading="lazy" alt="G2 logo" class="quotecard-avatar"/><div><div class="step-0">User Researcher</div><div class="step--1 text-color-secondary">Enterprise Health, Wellness, and Fitness</div></div></div><div data-wf--vertical-space--variant="m" class="spacer w-variant-2cc0820b-145a-e502-4fce-a96bdfafee33"></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="cardcolumns_item3 w-variant-b2725e9c-6f1b-5811-5d92-21e5db8293d6"><div class="cards_full-height"><div data-wf--logocard-jk--variant="base-no-stroke" class="statcard w-variant-ebd22ac8-23fc-aa88-9098-3a8b2c175b05"><div class="numbercard-content w-variant-ebd22ac8-23fc-aa88-9098-3a8b2c175b05"><div class="card_slot"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6740a730413debfacf115060/692f6fa747d6fd3c4ee9a213_359b767f961115ca0f7398051b5cbaa9_Cal-Meet-logo.svg" loading="lazy" width="70" data-wf--image--image-style="square-cover" alt="" data-style-image="" class="full-width_img w-variant-342b4d26-adaa-5b8f-b9df-dcdbd3879f86"/></div><div data-wf--vertical-space--variant="xl" class="spacer w-variant-23348c19-1ecd-e80f-378f-68c5aebe8e07"></div><div class="component_rtb-dark-text w-richtext"><p>Quickly schedule live interviews with auto-synced calendars, invites, and unique links for each participant.</p></div><div data-wf--vertical-space--variant="xs" class="spacer w-variant-0588b157-3093-8d53-2b14-4cd7cbeb464f"></div></div></div></div></div><div class="cardcolumns_item4 w-variant-b2725e9c-6f1b-5811-5d92-21e5db8293d6"><div class="cards_full-height"></div></div><div class="cardcolumns_item5 w-variant-b2725e9c-6f1b-5811-5d92-21e5db8293d6"><div class="cards_full-height"></div></div></div></div><div data-wf--vertical-space--variant="xl" class="spacer w-variant-23348c19-1ecd-e80f-378f-68c5aebe8e07"></div></section><div data-wf--cardcolumns--background-color="jade-90" class="cardcolumns w-variant-ec707c3e-e7ee-dac2-a4f1-7de6617ed334"><div data-wf--vertical-space--variant="xl" class="spacer w-variant-23348c19-1ecd-e80f-378f-68c5aebe8e07"></div><div><div class="cardcolumns_headline-slot w-variant-ec707c3e-e7ee-dac2-a4f1-7de6617ed334"><div data-wf--page-header---centered--text-color="light-text" class="align-center w-variant-575e0082-1335-f184-6b60-8e40f4800d86"><div class="text-align-center"><div class="eyebrow-flex"><div class="eyebrow">FORRESTER</div></div><div data-wf--vertical-space--variant="m" class="spacer w-variant-2cc0820b-145a-e502-4fce-a96bdfafee33"></div><div class="page-header_headlines"><div data-wf--max-width--variant="30rem" class="max-width w-variant-1bab78a8-e8f3-a110-f38c-0a1952d48c04"><div><h1 data-wf--serif-headline--variant="step-5" class="serif-headline_inline w-variant-b90e7deb-24ab-a6d6-206e-8c40584ede86">Total Economic Impact </h1><h1 data-wf--sans-serif-italics--variant="step-5" class="serif-italics-headline_inline w-variant-46e68da2-0c54-096b-5f1c-9db36f284dab">of  </h1><h1 data-wf--sans-serif-headline--variant="step-5" class="sans-serif-headline_inline w-variant-7328084f-8434-61d6-7b7a-b28f07cd0c52">Dscout</h1></div></div></div></div><div data-wf--vertical-space--variant="s" class="spacer w-variant-d5999bef-cbc7-290e-f889-7175919e6506"></div><div class="align-center w-variant-575e0082-1335-f184-6b60-8e40f4800d86"><div class="pageheader_paragraph"><div class="text-align-center"><div class="component_rtb-dark-text w-variant-575e0082-1335-f184-6b60-8e40f4800d86 w-richtext"><p>Through four customer interviews and data aggregation, Forrester concluded that Dscout has the following three-year financial impact.</p></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div data-wf--vertical-space--variant="l-xl" class="spacer w-variant-139c73de-ba49-ec56-1ec1-aea8d4558a9a"></div><div class="featurecolumns_slot w-variant-ec707c3e-e7ee-dac2-a4f1-7de6617ed334"><div data-wf--card-columns--variant="3-columns" class="cardcolumns_flex w-variant-aa231721-fa78-232c-e92c-11d9e53e9bbc"><div class="cardcolumns_item1"><div class="cards_full-height w-variant-aa231721-fa78-232c-e92c-11d9e53e9bbc"><div data-wf--stat-card--color="forrester" class="statcard w-variant-a68e68ba-ec38-136f-788d-1751980e2b16"><div class="numbercard-content w-variant-a68e68ba-ec38-136f-788d-1751980e2b16"><div class="card_slot"><div class="stat-text">$2.0M</div></div><div data-wf--vertical-space--variant="xl" class="spacer w-variant-23348c19-1ecd-e80f-378f-68c5aebe8e07"></div><h1 data-wf--sans-serif-headline--variant="step-2" class="sans-serif-headline_inline w-variant-201c6dcb-dcbf-adf8-9a19-4b14dec34c93">Net-present value</h1><div data-wf--vertical-space--variant="xs" class="spacer w-variant-0588b157-3093-8d53-2b14-4cd7cbeb464f"></div><div class="component_rtb-dark-text w-variant-a68e68ba-ec38-136f-788d-1751980e2b16 w-richtext"><p>over three years</p></div><div data-wf--vertical-space--variant="xs" class="spacer w-variant-0588b157-3093-8d53-2b14-4cd7cbeb464f"></div></div></div></div></div><div class="cardcolumns_item2"><div class="cards_full-height w-variant-aa231721-fa78-232c-e92c-11d9e53e9bbc"><div data-wf--stat-card--color="forrester" class="statcard w-variant-a68e68ba-ec38-136f-788d-1751980e2b16"><div class="numbercard-content w-variant-a68e68ba-ec38-136f-788d-1751980e2b16"><div class="card_slot"><div class="stat-text">320%</div></div><div data-wf--vertical-space--variant="xl" class="spacer w-variant-23348c19-1ecd-e80f-378f-68c5aebe8e07"></div><h1 data-wf--sans-serif-headline--variant="step-2" class="sans-serif-headline_inline w-variant-201c6dcb-dcbf-adf8-9a19-4b14dec34c93">Return on investment</h1><div data-wf--vertical-space--variant="xs" class="spacer w-variant-0588b157-3093-8d53-2b14-4cd7cbeb464f"></div></div></div></div></div><div id="w-node-_45cdf4f6-090f-e5fd-4fa3-404cae7380ee-ae7380eb" class="cardcolumns_item3 w-variant-aa231721-fa78-232c-e92c-11d9e53e9bbc"><div class="cards_full-height w-variant-aa231721-fa78-232c-e92c-11d9e53e9bbc"><div data-wf--stat-card--color="forrester" class="statcard w-variant-a68e68ba-ec38-136f-788d-1751980e2b16"><div class="numbercard-content w-variant-a68e68ba-ec38-136f-788d-1751980e2b16"><div class="card_slot"><div class="stat-text">&lt;6</div></div><div data-wf--vertical-space--variant="xl" class="spacer w-variant-23348c19-1ecd-e80f-378f-68c5aebe8e07"></div><h1 data-wf--sans-serif-headline--variant="step-2" class="sans-serif-headline_inline w-variant-201c6dcb-dcbf-adf8-9a19-4b14dec34c93">Months payback</h1><div data-wf--vertical-space--variant="xs" class="spacer w-variant-0588b157-3093-8d53-2b14-4cd7cbeb464f"></div></div></div></div></div><div class="cardcolumns_item4 w-variant-aa231721-fa78-232c-e92c-11d9e53e9bbc"><div class="cards_full-height w-variant-aa231721-fa78-232c-e92c-11d9e53e9bbc"><div data-wf--stat-card--color="forrester" class="statcard w-variant-a68e68ba-ec38-136f-788d-1751980e2b16"><div class="numbercard-content w-variant-a68e68ba-ec38-136f-788d-1751980e2b16"><div class="card_slot"><div class="stat-text">&lt;6</div></div><div data-wf--vertical-space--variant="xl" class="spacer w-variant-23348c19-1ecd-e80f-378f-68c5aebe8e07"></div><h1 data-wf--sans-serif-headline--variant="step-2" class="sans-serif-headline_inline w-variant-201c6dcb-dcbf-adf8-9a19-4b14dec34c93">Months payback</h1><div data-wf--vertical-space--variant="xs" class="spacer w-variant-0588b157-3093-8d53-2b14-4cd7cbeb464f"></div></div></div></div></div><div class="cardcolumns_item5 w-variant-aa231721-fa78-232c-e92c-11d9e53e9bbc"><div class="cards_full-height w-variant-aa231721-fa78-232c-e92c-11d9e53e9bbc"><div data-wf--stat-card--color="forrester" class="statcard w-variant-a68e68ba-ec38-136f-788d-1751980e2b16"><div class="numbercard-content w-variant-a68e68ba-ec38-136f-788d-1751980e2b16"><div class="card_slot"><div class="stat-text">&lt;6</div></div><div data-wf--vertical-space--variant="xl" class="spacer w-variant-23348c19-1ecd-e80f-378f-68c5aebe8e07"></div><h1 data-wf--sans-serif-headline--variant="step-2" class="sans-serif-headline_inline w-variant-201c6dcb-dcbf-adf8-9a19-4b14dec34c93">Months payback</h1><div data-wf--vertical-space--variant="xs" class="spacer w-variant-0588b157-3093-8d53-2b14-4cd7cbeb464f"></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div data-wf--vertical-space--variant="l" class="spacer w-variant-13e4797a-c62b-b476-4a73-bfbaabf18a32"></div></div><section fs-cmsstatic-order="5" col-span="4" fs-cmsstatic-element="static-item" data-wf--blockquote-jk--variant="jade-90" class="blockquote w-variant-a8108c50-256c-9a07-7a24-cb6a7c59d0da"><div data-wf--vertical-space--variant="s" class="spacer w-variant-d5999bef-cbc7-290e-f889-7175919e6506"></div><div><div data-wf--icon---quote-large--variant="base" class="blockquote_icon"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6740a730413debfacf115060/67eb6ad9331a6cc7f167ea51_Quotes-20px.svg" loading="lazy" alt=""/></div></div><div data-wf--vertical-space--variant="m" class="spacer w-variant-2cc0820b-145a-e502-4fce-a96bdfafee33"></div><div class="blockquote_max-w"><div class="slot-5"><h1 data-wf--serif-headline--variant="step-4" class="serif-headline_inline w-variant-5b8fa6d9-4a1a-c236-d354-9bf7aa310bb9">I don’t find myself having to constantly switch between different platforms...and I really can do everything from screening, recruiting, collecting, and analyzing data to creating clips and playlists for reporting,</h1><h1 data-wf--sans-serif-headline--variant="step-4" class="sans-serif-headline_inline w-variant-834b35ec-06bb-47e4-d538-9d167a717e19"> all within the Dscout platform.</h1></div></div><div data-wf--vertical-space--variant="l" class="spacer w-variant-13e4797a-c62b-b476-4a73-bfbaabf18a32"></div><div><div data-wf--avatar--variant="vertical" class="headerpost_contributors-flex w-variant-a43306b1-1f82-afe4-fa0d-350afdf9f2ef"><div data-wf--avatar-text--variant="light-text"><h3 class="step-0 sans text-weight-normal w-variant-fa2465fb-c70f-0388-dab2-1236ed0a2cf4">Senior Manager of Research</h3><div data-wf--vertical-space--variant="4xs" class="spacer"></div><div data-wf--vertical-space--variant="4xs" class="spacer"></div><div class="step--1 w-variant-fa2465fb-c70f-0388-dab2-1236ed0a2cf4">Education Technology</div></div></div></div><div data-wf--vertical-space--variant="l" class="spacer w-variant-13e4797a-c62b-b476-4a73-bfbaabf18a32"></div><div class="blockquote_buttons"><div data-wf--button-group--button-alignment="align-left" class="button-wrap-left"><a data-wf--button---primary-jade--button-color="primary" href="/customers/stanford-university" class="btn w-inline-block"><div class="step-0 text-weight-normal">Read more</div></a><a data-wf--button---text-link--text-link-style="light-text-r-arrow" data-w-id="e5328d33-7cdb-57ea-5640-a0c712ca7e13" href="/lp/total-economic-impact-of-dscout-paid-practitioner" class="button-text-link w-variant-1a6f6ad1-ceae-0fee-27dc-9de47ced839d w-inline-block"><div class="step-0 text-weight-normal">All case studies</div><div class="alertbanner_icon-container w-variant-1a6f6ad1-ceae-0fee-27dc-9de47ced839d"><div data-is-ix2-target="1" class="arrow-icon" data-w-id="e5552172-ccb4-1939-1dac-28b73f828371" data-animation-type="lottie" data-src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6740a730413debfacf115060/67aa28ebe7215683d56359d4_Arrow-24x24%20(1).json" data-loop="0" data-direction="1" data-autoplay="0" data-renderer="svg" data-default-duration="0" data-duration="0.7333333333333333" data-loading="eager" data-ix2-initial-state="0"></div></div></a></div></div><div class="w-embed"><style>
